
@contentType = application/json

### Logga in som admin — KÖR DENNA FÖRST i denna fil
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userName": "{{adminUserName}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Hämta alla beställare
GET {{host}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Skapa beställare → 201
# @name createCustomer
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "company": "Admin Test AB",
  "person": "Anna Andersson",
  "email": "anna@admintest.se",
  "phone": "0701234567",
  "organizationNumber": "556677-8899"
}

### Hämta beställare på id
GET {{host}}/api/customers/{{createCustomer.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Uppdatera beställare → 200
PATCH {{host}}/api/customers/{{createCustomer.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "person": "Bertil Bertilsson",
  "phone": "0709999999"
}

### Negativtest — Company saknas → 400
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "person": "Saknar company"
}

### Negativtest — ogiltig email → 400
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "company": "Test AB",
  "email": "inte-en-email"
}

### Kund som inte finns → 404
GET {{host}}/api/customers/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Radera beställare → 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/customers/{{createCustomer.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
